[0.005, "o", "\r\n  About to replace the operating system with ghcr.io/ublue-os/bluefin:stable (Bootc backend).\r\n  /boot and the EFI boot entries will be rewritten; data, accounts and settings are carried over.\r\n  A backup of /boot and the ESP is written to /var/lib/plexy/backup.\r\n"]
[0.004, "o", "\u001b[1;32m==>\u001b[0m \u001b[1mbacking up /boot and the EFI system partition to /var/lib/plexy/backup\u001b[0m\r\n"]
